[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22102.788, "timestamp": "06:08:22", "text": "去。没听到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22111.75, "timestamp": "06:08:31", "text": "好了。哦，不。多里安，失去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22113.99, "timestamp": "06:08:33", "text": "笑话书有时会让人很扫兴。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22116.31, "timestamp": "06:08:36", "text": "嘿，别担心。我相信你会来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22118.948, "timestamp": "06:08:38", "text": "想出一些你自己的精彩笑话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22121.03, "timestamp": "06:08:41", "text": "有时候，最好的笑话就是我们讲的那些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22123.59, "timestamp": "06:08:43", "text": "创造我们自己。祝你好运，玩得开心！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22126.15, "timestamp": "06:08:46", "text": "和你一起集思广益，想个笑话。张嘴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22128.47, "timestamp": "06:08:48", "text": "微笑书。"}]